### Get Overview Analytics
GET http://localhost:5000/api/analytics/overview?timeframe=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Ticket Creation & Resolution Trends
GET http://localhost:5000/api/analytics/trends?days=14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Technician Utilization & Performance
GET http://localhost:5000/api/analytics/technicians
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Asset Distribution & Warranty Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/analytics/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
